# LOAD-BEARING: do not delete these without reading CONTRIBUTING.md.
#
# Hoists @babel/* packages to the root node_modules so React Native's Metro
# bundler can resolve them. Without these, the mobile app fails to bundle
# with cryptic "Cannot find module @babel/..." errors. See the matching
# pnpm.packageExtensions block in package.json.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*@babel/generator*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*@babel/types*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*@babel/parser*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*@babel/traverse*

# Hoists react-native-worklets so CocoaPods' RNReanimated.podspec can resolve
# it via plain Node `require.resolve('react-native-worklets/package.json')`
# during `pod install` on EAS Build. react-native-worklets is a transitive
# dep of react-native-reanimated@4.x, and pnpm's strict isolation buries
# transitive deps in `.pnpm/...` where the podspec resolver can't find them.
# Failure mode: EAS Build's prebuild fails with "Cannot find module
# 'react-native-worklets/package.json'" during pod install. Local Metro
# bundling works fine — the failure is CocoaPods-only.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*react-native-worklets*
